{
  "id": "boss_warlord_hask",
  "name": "Warlord Hask of the Red Banner",
  "tier": "boss",
  "body": "brigand_captain",
  "place": "dungeon fortress_keep set B: the end boss on the keep's top floor, the war room (28 m)",
  "_doc": "Stream E (M2). The brigand warlord who took the keep and calls himself its lord. A loud, clever fighter. P1 \"Command\": a cleaver for the tank, a shield charge, and BANNERS — he plants red banners that buff him while he stands near one (pools with boss actions); break them by luring his charge (charge breaks objects). P2 at 60% \"Siege\": he holes up behind a shield wall with his lieutenants; the war-room has three SIGNAL FIRES (braziers) — light them and the keep's old garrison bell knocks his shield wall down. P3 new bar \"The Red Banner Falls\": a burning floor, ballista volleys at random players, a soak on the war table, his bodyguard returns, and a hard interrupt on his \"Rally\" heal.",
  "party": "Solo: very hard; with a follower OK. 2-3: one handles signal fires + soak. 5: as designed. M5: lieutenants +1 per player, soak need 2 at 5 players, health x1.8.",
  "hpMult": 4,
